    "title": "Motorcyclist critically injured in south Wichita crash - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Angela Smith ,\n2 hours ago WICHITA, Kan. — A motorcyclist was taken to the hospital in critical condition Wednesday evening after being struck by another vehicle near MacArthur and Broadway. Wichita police said the crash happened around 7:30 p.m. in the 4200 block of S. Broadway. A car exited a private drive and did not see the woman on the motorcycle. Read full article\n3",
